CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'od->_state == OMAP_DEVICE_STATE_ENABLED'
#83: FILE: arch/arm/mach-omap2/omap_device.c:227:
+		if (od && (od->_state == OMAP_DEVICE_STATE_ENABLED) &&
